{"id":"661298","name":"梅菜烧鸡爪","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661298/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡爪","amount":"适量"},{"name":"梅干菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米辣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"梅菜干清水泡发一下。","img":"images/661298/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡爪去甲后洗净。","img":"images/661298/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将鸡爪冷水下锅焯烫至洗净备用。","img":"images/661298/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片炒香。","img":"images/661298/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入鸡爪翻炒。","img":"images/661298/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，老抽，盐。","img":"images/661298/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色。","img":"images/661298/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将鸡爪转入高压锅。","img":"images/661298/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量清水，盖上煮开中小火压15分钟左右。","img":"images/661298/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"蒜头小米辣洗净切细。","img":"images/661298/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅中热油放入蒜末和小米辣。","img":"images/661298/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入梅菜干炒香。","img":"images/661298/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入焖好的鸡爪。","img":"images/661298/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"适量老抽翻炒上色。","img":"images/661298/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入适量鸡爪原汤，焖15分钟左右入味即可。","img":"images/661298/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661298/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661298/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661298/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}